#' GCAM future start year
#'
#' Starting year used for future GCAM model periods.
#'
#' @section Deprecated:
#' No longer used internally - year sequences are now derived at runtime
#' from actual query data (see `gcam_future_years()`). Retained only for
#' backward compatibility with code that may reference it directly, and
#' reflects the GCAM-USA v7.1 assumption (2020); not guaranteed to match
#' the base year of any GCAM-USA version you are actually running.
#'
#' @format A numeric value.
#' @keywords datasets
"GCAM_futr_start"

#' GCAM future end year
#'
#' Ending year used for future GCAM model periods.
#'
#' @section Deprecated:
#' No longer used internally - year sequences are now derived at runtime
#' from actual query data (see `gcam_future_years()`). Retained only for
#' backward compatibility with code that may reference it directly, and
#' reflects the GCAM-USA v7.1 assumption (2100); not guaranteed to match
#' the model end year of any GCAM-USA version you are actually running.
#'
#' @format A numeric value.
#' @keywords datasets
"GCAM_futr_end"

#' GCAM model time step
#'
#' Time step used between GCAM model years.
#'
#' @format A numeric value.
#' @keywords datasets
"GCAM_model_step"

#' Conversion factor from gigawatts to megawatts
#'
#' A numeric conversion factor used to convert GW to MW.
#'
#' @format A numeric value.
#' @keywords datasets
"convGW_MW"

#' Conversion factor from megawatts to kilowatts
#'
#' A numeric conversion factor used to convert MW to kW.
#'
#' @format A numeric value.
#' @keywords datasets
"convMW_kW"

