#' Nuclear capacity factor
#'
#' Fixed nuclear capacity factor used in GCAM-USA jobs calculations. Nuclear
#' is not covered by the 'GCAM_USA elec cap-fac by cooling tech' query (like
#' geo_cf and hydro_cf, it is handled as a separate fuel in GCAM_EJ()
#' rather than looked up from that query).
#'
#' @format A numeric value.
#' @keywords datasets
"nuc_cf"

